OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain soon clearing. Then
OL,6,Fwindy, with a mixture of sunny spells
OL,7,Fand variable amounts of cloud. The odd
OL,8,Fshower likely follows, heavy at times,
OL,9,Falthough some parts could stay dry.
OL,10,FTemperatures near normal, or just
OL,11,Fabove, for late October.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells and showers
OL,14,Fthrough the evening. Cloud then
OL,15,Fthickens after midnight, with further
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain possible, most
OL,17,Flikely in the northwest. Winds easing
OL,18,Fslightly, but staying breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
