OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOutbreaks of rain at first,
OL,6,Fhowever these gradually fading through
OL,7,Fthe morning with most places dry by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Some sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping, with winds also easing
OL,10,Ffurther. Rather mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FSettled with variable cloud and sunny
OL,14,Fspells, and temperatures near normal.
OL,15,FHowever, any overnight mist and fog
OL,16,Fpatches could be slow to clear. Winds
OL,17,Fbecoming light and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
